`review1/solution.ts` comes back on the spaced-review schedule.
`review1/snippet.ts`, again from inside a timer callback:

```ts
export function run(log: (label: string) => void): void {
  log("start");

  Promise.resolve()
    .then(() => {
      log("p1");
    })
    .then(() => {
      log("p2");
    });

